  "extra": {
    "lab_profile": "stills/lighting-trio",
    "lab_note": "## stills/lighting-trio\n\nFormat / platform sets pixels (Custom uses Width \u00d7 Height). Quality does not change size.\n\nSame subject under three lights (Klein 4B). Type any subject in IDENTITY. SHOT KEY is the identity plate. Queue the whole graph; 02\u201303 Klein-edit from 01 (VAEEncode + ReferenceLatent). Do not bypass KEY on a cold canvas.\nPrefixes `ez_light_01`\u2026`03` (key / window / night lamp). Change only the light.\n\nPrompt enhance is on by default (on-box Qwen3-4B-Instruct-2507). After Queue, the Enhance node shows the prompt CLIP used. Turn Enhance off to pin the widget text.\n\nOccupancy: klein \u2014 stop Wan, LTX, podcast, music. One GB10 job.\n",
    "lab_description": "Klein 4B three-light study of one subject",
    "lab_app_mode": {
      "enabled": true,
      "default_view": "app",
      "frontend_min": "1.41.13",
      "lane": "inspire",
      "occupancy": "klein",
      "enhance_off_identity": false,
      "handoff": []
    },
